{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17107","headline":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中 · 卢士政","name":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华堂良宴开，星使自天来。\n舞转朱丝逐，歌余素扇回。\n水光凌曲槛，夜色霭高台。\n不在宾阶末，何由接上台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢士政","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}